<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Le Moyne d&apos;Iberville returns about three months before the squadron sails. He had a sore arm for a day after the vaccines and nothing else. He has had no fever since his malaria treatment seven months ago. He will be aboard ship for the crossing and in the islands, then ashore near Cayenne and Kourou, possibly with river work inland where malaria is transmitted. He will be responsible for the health measures of his crews and wants to set the example. He asked what he should carry. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Vaccine reactions</td><td>Sore arm for a day</td></tr><tr><td>Malaria</td><td>No fever in seven months</td></tr><tr><td>Itinerary</td><td>Sea crossing, the Antilles, then French Guiana with possible inland river work</td></tr><tr><td>Question</td><td>What to carry and how to protect his crews</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

